id: pm-vcs-disposable-cleanup-contracts
title: Restore disposable cleanup force and primary-error contracts
description: "Separate generic caller-owned scratch cleanup from persistent namespace retirement. Review threads PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6yWzbn, PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6yWzbs, PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6yWzcF, PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6yWzcW, PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6yWzce and PRRT_kwDOToJT7M6yWzci identify valid cleanup-ledger, primary-error masking and force semantics concerns in installer, privacy, fetch, bisect and self-host helpers and durability.remove. These general API/scratch-lifetime contracts extend beyond this PR native pack/erasure provenance fix; gate-owned scratch cleanup already bounds CI storage. The current repair supplies a direct disposable helper for the in-scope benchmark and partial fragment output, without changing persistent retirement authority."
